WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.000
Father: My son feels sick - where is first aid?

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.800
Majed: Er... inside somewhere?

3
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:09.600
Narrator: Majed didn't walk his area.

4
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:13.400
Narrator: When a father needs first aid, Majed can't help.

5
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:29.300
Noura: First aid is next to the Info Point, Gate 5 - two minutes. Do you need medical help here? I can call them.

6
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:34.600
Narrator: Noura can - in seconds - and she offers to call medical help.

7
00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:38.400
Narrator: Walk your area before the gates open. Every time.

